{{!
    @template mod_videoconnect/page_header

    Co-branded page header (C10): Tresipunt logo + active provider logo on
    the left, page title and description on the right.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * logotresipunt: string - URL of the Tresipunt logo.
    * logoprovider: string - URL of the active provider logo.
    * providername: string - Name of the active video provider.
    * headertitle: string - Page title.
    * headerdesc: string - One/two line page description.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "logotresipunt": "#",
        "logoprovider": "#",
        "providername": "Vimeo",
        "headertitle": "Video Connect control panel",
        "headerdesc": "Every campus video with its publication state."
    }
}}
<div class="vc-header-brand">
    <img src="{{logotresipunt}}" alt="Tresipunt" class="vc-header-logo">
    <span class="vc-header-divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <img src="{{logoprovider}}" alt="{{#str}} provideralt, mod_videoconnect, {{providername}} {{/str}}" class="vc-header-logo">
</div>
<div class="vc-header-text">
    <h1 class="vc-header-title">{{headertitle}}</h1>
    <p class="vc-header-desc">{{headerdesc}}</p>
</div>
